1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,460
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She has a big dog.

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:05,460
It is a German Shepherd.

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,160
She loves her dog.

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,220
She walks it around town.

5
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,620
Strangers always go up to her dog.

6
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,440
They pet it.

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,440
They pet it without asking.

8
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,900
She gets mad.

9
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:25,460
She does not like people touching her dog.

10
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,060
She pulls her dog away from people.
